WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.625
Sir. Looking for Captain Leo.

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:10.125
You must've really messed up
if they sent you to Leo.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.917
Do you know why you're here?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.583
Because I broke chain of command.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.292
Harp, he's not like us.

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:24.875
-You're a--
-Your commanding officer,

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.250
and I'm giving you
60 seconds to deal with it.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.375
Yes, sir.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:32.500
Cool.

00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:36.333
What are you? AI?

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:38.583
A Gump's AI. I'm a prototype.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:39.958
My existence is classified.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.583
But I can't do this alone.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:45.542
I need someone who can
think outside the box.

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.417
That's why you're here.
I chose you.

00:00:48.042 --> 00:00:50.458
-You got a picture of her?
-I'm not having this conversation.

00:00:50.542 --> 00:00:52.167
Hey, it's fair game, rookie.

00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:54.042
She's a hottie. Congratulations.

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:55.042
-Thank you.
-Hey.

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:56.458
"My gummy bear?"

00:00:57.458 --> 00:00:58.875
My gummy bear.

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.042
Please, tell me what you know.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:04.792
-In front of him?
-You can trust him.

00:01:05.792 --> 00:01:06.875
These are your informants.

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:08.625
Listen, I'm a combat soldier,

00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:10.042
but I feel more than you think.

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.500
I can't do this with eyes on me.

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:14.583
They put your tracker
on your back?

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:17.083
Sometimes you gotta get dirty
to see any real change.

00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:21.583
Welcome to the war, kid.

00:01:26.917 --> 00:01:29.417
This seems a bit beyond protocol&nbsp;
for whatever you are.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.083
I need you to trust me, Harp.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.625
What will you do
with so much power?

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.333
We can be good allies.

00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:44.083
In extreme situations,

00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:47.000
I have the ability
to break the rules just like you.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.625
What's going on, Harp?

00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:52.167
-I removed his fail-safe.
-You did what?

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:55.875
If your war machine
turns against you,

00:01:55.958 --> 00:01:56.958
why should I care?

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.042
How long do you think&nbsp;
you'll survive out here?

00:02:00.042 --> 00:02:00.943
on your own

00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:03.292
What are you using me for?

00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:09.083
Do you trust me?

